      "serialized_row_index": 26,
      "source_cells": [
        "",
        "",
        "主人公",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "皆さん、どうしたんですか？"
      ],
      "speaker": "主人公",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "voice": ""
    },
    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "561f0571ecf80a0a9273c171c272ccf9cda6d7ea0bc26d8437d9fd02284413c9",
      "grid_index": 0,
      "grid_message_index_0based": 4,
      "header_row_index_0based": 0,
      "hold": false,
      "hold_placeholder": null,
      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "あっ、ご主人さま。\n実はふとした話から、エピルさんのことを「かわいい」と\n褒めてしまって。そうしたら、あんなことに。",
      "jp_sha256": "1c1e0b9d1cbe9490a05555a74beee77feb52ead786207221334e09a59ac1eaf5",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "앗, 주인님.\n사실 우연히 나온 이야기에서 에피루 씨를 『귀엽다』고\n칭찬했어요. 그랬더니 저렇게 되어 버려서요.",
      "message_index_0based": 4,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 28,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
      "reason": "",
      "review_id": "monmusu-pro-b003-20261105-same-model-pass2-r1",
      "review_note": "",
      "review_status": "reviewed",
      "row_id": "6e2b2f592a3b520b14d4a5ab649f0e02b76132a9a181b68f63f489edcce79849:000002_381289050250042221:g0:r27",
      "row_index_0based": 27,
      "serialized_row_index": 27,
      "source_cells": [
        "",
        "",
        "エテジア",
        "Emt10_Sad",
        "layer_中",
        "",
        "",
        "0.3",
        "",
        "あっ、ご主人さま。\n実はふとした話から、エピルさんのことを「かわいい」と\n褒めてしまって。そうしたら、あんなことに。",
        "",
        "ch_10001/R18/10059A0_10001_Nml/10059A0_10001_002",
        "",
        ""
      ],
